## Purpose

This Business Continuity Plan (BCP) establishes procedures to maintain critical business operations during and after a disruptive event, ensuring minimal impact to customers and stakeholders.

---

## Scope

This plan covers:
- Production systems and infrastructure
- Critical business functions
- Key personnel and locations
- Customer service continuity
- Recovery procedures

