## Disaster Recovery Architecture

### Infrastructure Overview

| Component | Primary | Secondary | Failover |
|-----------|---------|-----------|----------|
| Cloud Region | AWS us-east-1 | AWS us-west-2 | Automatic |
| Database | Aurora Primary | Aurora Replica | < 5 min |
| Application | Multi-AZ | Multi-AZ | < 2 min |
| CDN | CloudFront | CloudFront | Automatic |
| DNS | Route 53 | Route 53 | < 5 min |

### Data Replication

| Data Type | Method | Lag | Retention |
|-----------|--------|-----|-----------|
| Database | Synchronous replication | < 1 sec | N/A |
| Object Storage | Cross-region replication | < 15 min | 90 days |
| Configuration | Infrastructure as code | N/A | Git versioned |
| Backups | Cross-region copy | 1 hour | 30 days |

### Backup Strategy

| Type | Frequency | Retention | Location |
|------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Full Database | Daily | 30 days | Multi-region |
| Incremental | Every 15 minutes | 7 days | Multi-region |
| Transaction Logs | Continuous | 7 days | Multi-region |
| Application | Daily | 30 days | Multi-region |
| Configuration | On change | Unlimited | Git |

