## Response Procedures

### Initial Response (0-1 hour)

| Step | Action | Owner | Target |
|------|--------|-------|--------|
| 1 | Incident detected/reported | Monitoring/Anyone | Immediate |
| 2 | Initial assessment | On-call | 15 min |
| 3 | Classify severity | On-call + Manager | 30 min |
| 4 | Activate BC team (Level 1-2) | BC Coordinator | 30 min |
| 5 | Establish command center | BC Coordinator | 45 min |
| 6 | Initial customer notification | Comms Lead | 1 hour |

### Stabilization (1-4 hours)

| Step | Action | Owner | Target |
|------|--------|-------|--------|
| 7 | Detailed damage assessment | Tech Teams | 2 hours |
| 8 | Implement workarounds | Operations | 2 hours |
| 9 | Customer communication | CS + Comms | 2 hours |
| 10 | Begin recovery procedures | Tech Teams | 2 hours |
| 11 | Status update to executives | BC Coordinator | Every 2 hours |
| 12 | External notification (if needed) | Legal/Comms | As required |

### Recovery (4-48 hours)

| Step | Action | Owner | Target |
|------|--------|-------|--------|
| 13 | Execute recovery plan | Tech Teams | Per RTO |
| 14 | Validate systems | QA + Security | After recovery |
| 15 | Restore customer operations | Operations | After validation |
| 16 | Monitor stability | Operations | 24 hours |
| 17 | Customer all-clear | CS + Comms | After stability |
| 18 | Stand down BC team | BC Coordinator | After stability |

### Post-Incident (48 hours+)

| Step | Action | Owner | Target |
|------|--------|-------|--------|
| 19 | Post-incident review | BC Coordinator | 5 days |
| 20 | Root cause analysis | Tech Lead | 10 days |
| 21 | Lessons learned | Full team | 14 days |
| 22 | Update BCP | BC Coordinator | 30 days |
| 23 | Customer debrief (major) | CS | As needed |

