## Recovery Procedures

### Database Recovery

| Scenario | Procedure | RTO |
|----------|-----------|-----|
| Region failure | Failover to replica | < 5 min |
| Corruption | Point-in-time recovery | < 2 hours |
| Data loss | Restore from backup | < 4 hours |
| Complete loss | Full restore | < 8 hours |

### Application Recovery

| Scenario | Procedure | RTO |
|----------|-----------|-----|
| Region failure | DNS failover to secondary | < 15 min |
| Deployment failure | Rollback to previous | < 30 min |
| Complete rebuild | Deploy from IaC | < 2 hours |

### Network Recovery

| Scenario | Procedure | RTO |
|----------|-----------|-----|
| Primary ISP failure | Failover to secondary | Automatic |
| DNS failure | Secondary provider | < 5 min |
| CDN failure | Direct to origin | < 10 min |

